    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-prov2">
        <head xml:id="gom-prov2-Hd1e98">Caput 2</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov2-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov2-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov2-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_1@1-2">Fili mi.</quote>
            Duo hic notat, sapientiam esse de coelestibus, prudentiam de saecularibus.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov2-d1e110">
            <ref xml:id="gom-prov2-Rd1e112" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_1@1-2"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e114"><seg type="qs">Abscondit mandata Dei penes se</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quasi semen secus viam jactatum volucres tollant.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov2-Dd1e123">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov2-Hd1e125">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov2-d1e127">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e129" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_2@2-3">Audiat sapientiam.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e132"><seg type="qs">Audit non aure</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">hoc est enim quod sequitur:</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov2-d1e140">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e142" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_2@6-7">Inclina cor.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e145"><seg type="qs">Inclina, humilia, munda</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et revelasti ea humilibus.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov2-Dd1e154">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov2-Hd1e156">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov2-d1e158">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e160" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_3@1-4">Si enim sapientiam invocaveris.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e163"><seg type="qs">Invocare</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">nec liberum debet abesse arbitrium.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov2-Dd1e172">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov2-Hd1e174">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov2-d1e176">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e178" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_4@6-8">Et sicut thesauros.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e181"><seg type="qs">Qui thesauros effodit, <pb ed="#P" n="1083B"/></seg> etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">nec quiescat, donec inveniat.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov2-Dd1e192">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov2-Hd1e194">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov2-d1e196">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e198" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_5@1-2">Tunc intelliges.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e201"><seg type="qs">Timorem amicabilem</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sed etiam scientiam ipsius divinitatis (quae perpetuo beatum facit) invenies.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov2-Dd1e210">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov2-Hd1e212">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov2-d1e214">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e216" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_6@1-3">Quia Dominus dat.</quote>
            Respicit hic versiculus ab hoc quod supra dixerat: <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e219" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_3@1-4">Si enim sapientiam invocaveris,</quote> etc.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov2-d1e223">
            <ref xml:id="gom-prov2-Rd1e225" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_6@1-3"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e227"><seg type="qs">Ideo namque sapientia</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sed a Domino datur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov2-d1e235">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e237" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_6@6-7">Ex ore.</quote>
            Aeterna filii nativitate, de qua alibi: <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e240" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir24_5@1-9">Ego ex ore Altissimi prodii, primogenita ante omnem creaturam<!-- check: Migne cites is58; text matches sir24_5 --></quote>. Vel, os Domini in sanctis, unde: <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e244" source="http://scta.info/resource/is1_20@13-16">Os Domini locutum est.</quote> Et ex ore ejus scientia nascitur et prudentia, dum Dominus os humanum sanctificat, et suum facit, ut scienter et prudenter loquatur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov2-Dd1e249">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov2-Hd1e251">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov2-d1e253">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1083C"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e257" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_7@1-1">Custodiet.</quote>
            Ut in quocunque virtutum gradu rectos juvet et simplices. Job <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e260" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob1_1@12-14">simplex et rectus</quote>;
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov2-d1e264">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e266" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_7@7-7">simplex,</quote>
            per innocentiam mansuetudinis, <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e269">et rectus,</quote> per cautelam discretionis: <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e271" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_7@7-7">simplex,</quote> nullum laedens, imo cunctis proficiens, <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e274">rectus,</quote> a nullo corruptus.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov2-Dd1e278">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov2-Hd1e280">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov2-d1e282">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e284" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_12@4-5">A via mala.</quote>
            Ad quam vocant, qui dicunt: <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e287" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov1_11@3-6">Veni nobiscum, insidiemur sanguini, perversa loquitur,</quote> qui est auctor hujus persuasionis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov2-Dd1e292">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov2-Hd1e294">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov2-d1e296">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e298" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_13@1-3">Qui relinquunt iter.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e301"><seg type="qs">Pulchre</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">finis ejus in tenebris exterioribus.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov2-Dd1e310">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov2-Hd1e312">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov2-d1e314">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e316" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_14@1-2">Qui laetantur.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e319"><seg type="qs">Quia per vias tenebrosas ambulant</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">noxiamque laetitiam salubri fletu castigarent.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov2-Dd1e329">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov2-Hd1e331">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov2-d1e333">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e335" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_16@1-4">Ut eruaris a muliere.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e338"><seg type="qs">Pendet hic versus, <pb ed="#P" n="1083D"/></seg> etc., usque ad: <seg type="qs"><quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e344" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps54_22@18-21">et ipsi sunt jacula.</quote></seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov2-Dd1e349">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov2-Hd1e351">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov2-d1e353">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e355" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_17@1-3">Et relinquit ducem.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e358"><seg type="qs">Patet et de mente haeretica</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quam se die baptismi servaturam promiserat.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov2-Dd1e367">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov2-Hd1e369">Versus 18</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov2-d1e371">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e373" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_18@2-4">Pacti Dei sui,</quote>
            etc. Quod cum viro suo tempore nuptiarum pepigit, Domino teste, quod fidem, scilicet castitatis sibi invicem servarent, vel in baptismo.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov2-d1e377">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e379" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_18@7-9">Inclinata est enim.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e382"><seg type="qs">Omnis conversatio adulterae ad interitum ducit</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">id est, ad spirituum tendit tormenta malignorum.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov2-Dd1e391">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov2-Hd1e393">Versus 19</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov2-d1e395">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e397" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_19@4-7">Ad eam non revertentur. Mortem</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e400"><seg type="qs">scilicet, non mulierem</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">non sibi attribuat, sed gratiae Dei.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov2-Dd1e409">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov2-Hd1e411">Versus 21</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov2-d1e413">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1084A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e417" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_21@1-2">Qui enim.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e420"><seg type="qs">Hic rectis jungit simplices</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quae cum Christo in coelis regnat, perveniunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov2-Dd1e429">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov2-Hd1e431">Versus 22</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov2-d1e433">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e435" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov2_22@1-1">Impii.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e438"><seg type="qs">De illis dicitur specialiter</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">de fine bonorum, <quote xml:id="gom-prov2-Qd1e444" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov1_33@1-7">qui autem me audierit, absque terrore quiescet.</quote></seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
